    Bug 2023077 - Intermittent comm/mail/components/addrbook/test/browser/browser_display_multiple.js | testSelectMultiple - list members are correct. r=arschmitz

    The main problem for the test was apparently the subDialog loading not being complete.
    The test now works locally with --verify but failed like on CI before.

    Remove an anchient workaound, and clean up a bit.
    There were a bunch of focusing which shouldn't happen. The focus on name on timeout must however stay.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D287955

